    },
    {
      "mechanism": "Cross-Space Call Atomicity & Boundary Isolation",
      "details": "Conflux features dual environments: Core Space and eSpace. Cross-space interactions occur through an internal system contract (0x0888000000000000000000000000000000000006). These operations run synchronously within the virtual machine with strict call boundaries, preventing cross-environment state corruption and recursive callback exploits during token bridging."
